{"title": "Fury of the Small", "pageid": 19517, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fury_of_the_Small", "categories": ["Bugs", "Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp, /w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fury of the Small</b> is a racial ability of <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblins</a>. This ability allows a goblin to deal extra damage against an enemy larger than the goblin once per combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you damage a creature larger than you, you can choose to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" title=\"Physical\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Physical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">Physical</span></a> extra. Limited to once per combat. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblin</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aggy\" title=\"Aggy\">Aggy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Azak\" title=\"Azak\">Azak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bal\" title=\"Bal\">Bal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Benta\" title=\"Benta\">Benta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bez\" title=\"Bez\">Bez</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Birka\" title=\"Birka\">Birka</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bolt\" title=\"Bolt\">Bolt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brakkal\" title=\"Brakkal\">Brakkal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Breg\" title=\"Breg\">Breg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brek\" title=\"Brek\">Brek</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Clack\" title=\"Clack\">Clack</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Crub\" title=\"Crub\">Crub</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Crusher\" title=\"Crusher\">Crusher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cry\" title=\"Cry\">Cry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Culk\" title=\"Culk\">Culk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Darra\" title=\"Darra\">Darra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dextor\" title=\"Dextor\">Dextor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drenn\" title=\"Drenn\">Drenn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Druk\" title=\"Druk\">Druk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dullwill\" title=\"Dullwill\">Dullwill</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eef\" title=\"Eef\">Eef</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eight\" title=\"Eight\">Eight</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fezk\" title=\"Fezk\">Fezk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\">Fezzerk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Five\" title=\"Five\">Five</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Four\" title=\"Four\">Four</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gald\" title=\"Gald\">Gald</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glomp\" title=\"Glomp\">Glomp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gnat\" title=\"Gnat\">Gnat</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\">Grat</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\">Greez</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gresh\" title=\"Gresh\">Gresh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gribbo\" title=\"Gribbo\">Gribbo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grikka\" title=\"Grikka\">Grikka</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gronag\" title=\"Gronag\">Gronag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grush\" title=\"Grush\">Grush</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gruz\" title=\"Gruz\">Gruz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurd\" title=\"Gurd\">Gurd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurk\" title=\"Gurk\">Gurk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurza\" title=\"Gurza\">Gurza</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Huk\" title=\"Huk\">Huk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jawn\" title=\"Jawn\">Jawn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kirz\" title=\"Kirz\">Kirz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\">Klagga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kramp\" title=\"Kramp\">Kramp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Krolla\" title=\"Krolla\">Krolla</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Krug\" title=\"Krug\">Krug</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lora_(goblin)\" title=\"Lora (goblin)\">Lora (goblin)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mezzka\" title=\"Mezzka\">Mezzka</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mirg\" title=\"Mirg\">Mirg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moke\" title=\"Moke\">Moke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mrak\" title=\"Mrak\">Mrak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Muzul\" title=\"Muzul\">Muzul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nass\" title=\"Nass\">Nass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Neem\" title=\"Neem\">Neem</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nik-Nuk\" title=\"Nik-Nuk\">Nik-Nuk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nozk\" title=\"Nozk\">Nozk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nrog\" title=\"Nrog\">Nrog</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Olak\" title=\"Olak\">Olak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/One\" title=\"One\">One</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orik\" title=\"Orik\">Orik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Piddle\" title=\"Piddle\">Piddle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Plagg\" title=\"Plagg\">Plagg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Plig\" title=\"Plig\">Plig</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Puce\" title=\"Puce\">Puce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Puli\" title=\"Puli\">Puli</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Raagg\" title=\"Raagg\">Raagg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Racha\" title=\"Racha\">Racha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rancer\" title=\"Rancer\">Rancer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rindle\" title=\"Rindle\">Rindle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ripper\" title=\"Ripper\">Ripper</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rizzle\" title=\"Rizzle\">Rizzle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roo\" title=\"Roo\">Roo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rot\" title=\"Rot\">Rot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rozzak\" title=\"Rozzak\">Rozzak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rua\" title=\"Rua\">Rua</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sazza\" title=\"Sazza\">Sazza</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shekt\" title=\"Shekt\">Shekt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skrut\" title=\"Skrut\">Skrut</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Slice\" title=\"Slice\">Slice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sluck\" title=\"Sluck\">Sluck</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sneem\" title=\"Sneem\">Sneem</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Snurd\" title=\"Snurd\">Snurd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spike\" title=\"Spike\">Spike</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sul_(goblin)\" title=\"Sul (goblin)\">Sul (goblin)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tak\" title=\"Tak\">Tak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Three\" title=\"Three\">Three</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tiny_(Goblin)\" title=\"Tiny (Goblin)\">Tiny (Goblin)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tizg\" title=\"Tizg\">Tizg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Torrack\" title=\"Torrack\">Torrack</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tozad\" title=\"Tozad\">Tozad</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Trinzas\" title=\"Trinzas\">Trinzas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Trunk_(goblin)\" title=\"Trunk (goblin)\">Trunk (goblin)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tud\" title=\"Tud\">Tud</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vermit\" title=\"Vermit\">Vermit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vez\" title=\"Vez\">Vez</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vrak\" title=\"Vrak\">Vrak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wasp\" title=\"Wasp\">Wasp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Weneg\" title=\"Weneg\">Weneg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wim\" title=\"Wim\">Wim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Worm\" title=\"Worm\">Worm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zami\" title=\"Zami\">Zami</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zurga\" title=\"Zurga\">Zurga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zurk\" title=\"Zurk\">Zurk</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive is exclusively found on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty and cannot be acquired by player characters.</li>\n<li>Disguising as a small-sized race with <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguise Self</a> (such as a gnome) prevents Fury of the Small from triggering, whereas disguising as a medium-sized race causes Fury of the Small to trigger, even when used by small-sized races.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Contrary to the description, this feature is not reset upon the goblin leaving combat and is instead only usable once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203320\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 754/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6767/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3756/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5095/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 694809/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.179      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   51.179  